f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S\\)</span> (back-and-forth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f70d3e40a3983162\" href=\"?note=f70d3e40a3983162\" title=\"58-df-elementary-back-and-forth\">58-df-elementary-back-and-forth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelBackAndForthSystem}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelBackAndForthSystem}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}back\\text{-}and\\text{-}forth\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelBackAndForthSystem}_S(P,A,B,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S(P,A,B,L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}back\\text{-}and\\text{-}forth\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelBackAndForthSystem}_S(P,A,B,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S(P,A,B,L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This label reuses the established four-place back-and-forth predicate, which already requires that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> are structures in the same language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"